									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4120#msg4120">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #33 on:</b> December 28, 2003, 05:47:20 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Making fun of raiding Vindi may be laughable to Ascent and Arirang and whoever else, but you guys are not in touch with reality. &nbsp;You may find this difficult to believe, but some of the players on Rodcet Nife don&#039;t play EQ 24/7. &nbsp;These people are part of guilds like OA. &nbsp;Raiding Vindi is still a big deal for these people. &nbsp;I don&#039;t know who KS&#039;d what or who cleared first, but just because it&#039;s a &quot;shit mob&quot; to Ascent doesn&#039;t mean it&#039;s a shit mob to everyone else. &nbsp;That certainly would not justify taking it.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
