								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4173#msg4173"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4173#msg4173">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #40 on:</b> December 29, 2003, 11:37:46 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I totaly soloed Vindi just last night, busted by Ssnakess w/ the patented swim motion, tripped Karadana w/ my shield, and threw a nuddy magazine at Sys and he stopped dead in his tracks.<br /><br />And I didn&#039;t even use a spell or pet it was all just like this <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/chair.gif" alt="chair" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
