	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg4189"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=40" title="View the profile of Brokenfang">Brokenfang</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=40"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4189#msg4189"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4189#msg4189">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #41 on:</b> December 30, 2003, 08:32:57 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eh, hadn&#039;t even seen this thread. &nbsp;The other one didn&#039;t seem worth sticking my nose into.<br /><br />Anyway. &nbsp;Still not going to say much about what went on that night. &nbsp;Far as I&#039;m concerned it&#039;s done and over with. &nbsp;Ssnakes and I spent a good amount of time in tells after each sides first wipe. &nbsp;We reached an agreement, he and his group held through on it. &nbsp;Yea, there was some not so stellar words/actions on either side prior to that. &nbsp;But that leads into my next part.<br /><br />We all react out of line sometimes when we feel we&#039;ve been wronged. &nbsp;I&#039;m not gonna fault Kinny raving any more then I&#039;m going to fault Lanquay for the attempted train. &nbsp;I&#039;d like to think we&#039;re all big enough to look after the heat of the moment and be adults about things next time around. &nbsp;<br /><br />Bear in mind too that a forum like this definately changes how people react. &nbsp;In reading the posts from some of the other Ascent people there that night I notice some very distinct differences from the conversation Ssnakes and I had that night. &nbsp;It&#039;s one of the major reasons I don&#039;t much read these boards and likely would have never found this post if not for being directed here from someone else. &nbsp;The audience factor of a message board serves only to generate more hostility, not aid in relieving it.<br /><br />Anyway, I&#039;d ask that it all just be dropped. &nbsp;Whether you believe it or not Kin isn&#039;t a bad guy. &nbsp;Apparently can be hot tempered, but I&#039;m seeing that on both sides here. &nbsp;And quite frankly, as has been said numerous times already, Vindi isn&#039;t a mob worth having this much BS over. &nbsp;<br /><br />For what it&#039;s worth, Mamael, I did hear that you had rezzed some of us in, and of the polite tells sent to at least one of our members. &nbsp;I hadn&#039;t known about the MGB HoV, but regardless, I do appreciate it. &nbsp;Not every contest needs to be hostile and end in harsh feelings. &nbsp;For what it&#039;s worth I walked away from the thing sorry that a stupid mob had to put a damper on the moods of so many people. &nbsp;Both ours and yours.<br /><br />Anyway. &nbsp;If I&#039;ve offended anyone or anyone has something else to say, I can be reached as Brokenfang in game most nights of the week. &nbsp;Hopefully this can just be let to die though...it&#039;s really not worth the grief.<br /><br /><br />EDIT - Completly unrelated to anything. &nbsp;It shouldn&#039;t say guild leader by name anymore. &nbsp;The guild I led has merged into OA. &nbsp;
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: December 30, 2003, 09:01:10 pm by Brokenfang</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=26254" target="_blank">Master Brokenfang Silverhart</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
