							Cartier had a good point. &nbsp;I think Ascent has more fun trying to single group old content then anything else they do :p &nbsp;They have to be one of the easiest guilds around to work something out with- at least if you&#039;re not directly competing for current content with them I assume <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> &nbsp;Except that Kurtzu guy. &nbsp;He&#039;s a monster. &nbsp;:p
