							It is fun to single group stuff, or attempt too anyhow.<br /><br />I think the best I&#039;ve been able to do Vindi is with a 8-9 man crew kill. We&#039;re still working on getting the numbers to a single group. But Twink farmage is fun at the same time.<br /><br />It&#039;s all about challenges. Ascent recognizes this and enjoys a challenge. So do many others.
